s seem to be bound to a particular brand of the world-but let's stretch the world a bit. If the world were to shatter, and Pangaea descend on the modern world, with a new wave of Pangaeans emerging from the it, what would one look like?<br /> <br /> Story hooks for you non-Dark Era people coming up if this is answered.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2022Coin, Golden and Beloved<br /> <br /> \u2022City, Silver and Rapacious<br /> <br /> \u2022War, Viridian and Undying<br /> <br /> And others I can't properly think of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T08:31:30-07:00","id":861851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/855280-pangaea-unleashed?p=861833#post861833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u2022Coin, Golden and Beloved<br /> <br /> \u2022City, Silver and Rapacious<br /> <br /> \u2022War, Viridian and Undying<br /> <br /> And others I can't properly think of.</div> </div> </div> </div>Terror, the Faceless Nemesis<br /> <br /> Debt, the Insatiable Shadow of Coin<br /> <br /> Net, Ubiquitous and Omniscient","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her