imate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you mean Pangaean-oriented Gifts?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes yes Gifts and probably other kinds of blessings, that have been lost when the border marches collapsed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-02T11:44:06-07:00","id":1136664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/855280-pangaea-unleashed?p=1131784#post1131784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes yes Gifts and probably other kinds of blessings, that have been lost when the border marches collapsed.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There won't really have been any specific Gifts accorded to them. Shadow Gifts represent broad symbolic concepts shone through the lens of the Uratha's predatory nature; the only Gifts that might have existed Back Then that wouldn't exist in the modern world would be for concepts that simply ceased to exist in the meantime. It's possible there was a 'Pangaea' Wolf Gift, for example, letting Uratha manipulate Pangaean depth, find paths between the worlds, and stab up Pangaeans or interlopers more easily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/>